        "Title": "Operation Skyfall",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110984599025",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 90527ca8-b658-4b26-bc0a-9c7018881814).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. After Colorado, we did some digging, and our suspicions were confirmed.\r\rAll our previous targets so far were all part of an organization called Operation Skyfall, a doomsday cult of sorts that is preparing to quite literally end the world. Obviously, we cannot let this happen.\r\rWe tracked down two of their operatives in the GAMA private hospital in Hokkaido, Japan: Ray Miller and Tamami Kuroki. Eliminating them should throw a wrench in the cult&apos;s plans.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
